  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Bluff 10 ranks.</p>\n<p>You say something profoundly troubling to a creature. You must outwit the target as a cost to quip. The target must succeed at a Will saving throw or be stunned for 1 round.</p>\n<p>As part of this (quip), you can attempt a Bluff check to make a troubling claim (new skill use). If you succeed and invoked one of the target’s motivations, they are staggered for 1d4+1 rounds whether or not they failed their saving throw.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bluster#toc42\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
